{"id":"n60696-3-7","stage":4,"title":"불러들이다 · 召唤","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60696-3-7-1","ko":"무슨 일로 법원에서 우리를 불러들이는 거지?","zh":"法院找我们过去是有什么事吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일로","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"법원에서","meaning":"法院","explanation":"법원：法院；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"법원","audio":"/audio/61dea3dcc7987dae8f2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14459","senseId":"1","lemma":"법원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리를","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불러들이는","meaning":"召唤，唤入，唤来","explanation":"불러들이다：召唤，唤入，唤来；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"불러들이다","audio":"/audio/44326b83cf653065a38d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60696","senseId":"3","lemma":"불러들이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거지?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"61dea3dcc7987dae","term":"법원","zh":"法院","audio":"/audio/61dea3dcc7987dae8f2a.mp3","entryId":"14459","definition":"进行裁判的国家机关。","pronunciation":["버붠"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"44326b83cf653065","term":"불러들이다","zh":"召唤，唤入，唤来","audio":"/audio/44326b83cf653065a38d.mp3","entryId":"60696","definition":"执行国家事务的机关下达命令使某人前来。","pronunciation":["불러드리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/091b21d84a67d2e5c61d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60696-3-7-2","ko":"글쎄, 일단 가 보면 알겠지.","zh":"唉，先去了就知道了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄,","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄：也许吧，或许吧，难说","readings":[{"term":"글쎄","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29723","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일단","meaning":"暂时","explanation":"일단：暂时","readings":[{"term":"일단","audio":"/audio/47a337529350ca3ed26b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25132","senseId":"2","lemma":"일단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보면","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"3","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알겠지.","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7ca52d3e5ceed208","term":"글쎄","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3","entryId":"29723","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄"]},{"id":"47a337529350ca3e","term":"일단","zh":"暂时","audio":"/audio/47a337529350ca3ed26b.mp3","entryId":"25132","definition":"先在短时间内。","pronunciation":["일딴"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a6d329e772226a9d3355.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.989,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60696","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":142,"sequenceScore":2.8157,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["法院找我们过去是有什么事吗？","唉，先去了就知道了。","为什么不换东西，直接就回来了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["法院找我们过去是有什么事吗？","唉，先去了就知道了。","为什么不换东西，直接就回来了？"],"answer":1}]}
